{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.poster.avif?t=1773562420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.webm?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.mp4?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack the Reaper has had enough. He is done being part of the bad guys. With the help of various mentors, he borrows powers from other infamous Halloween Creatures, like Count the Vampire or Grim the Death Reaper (and much more). With their skills, and Jack's power of nature's darkness, he combines them all to battle waves and waves of Halloween Horror in hopes to escape the dark forest he has been trapped in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/7bfb21e7c983f61ef985c40ff8dd81cf.poster.avif?t=1773562420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/7bfb21e7c983f61ef985c40ff8dd81cf.webm?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/7bfb21e7c983f61ef985c40ff8dd81cf.mp4?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and Fast runs (5-15 minutes per run), depending on how well your build is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy Skills appear when two compatible horrific skills match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock More Monster Mentors for more skill choices in each run\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon Permanent Pumpkin head Minions to aid you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of monsters lasting 30 to 90 seconds each and try to escape the Enchanted Forest Jack has been trapped in and learn who the mastermind behind all this</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6f8285849bc58b465501a05701256f50.poster.avif?t=1773562420\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6f8285849bc58b465501a05701256f50.webm?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/6f8285849bc58b465501a05701256f50.mp4?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hall Of Horrors showcasing all the potential mentors of Jack, with each varying story and set of skills potentially creating strong and powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.poster.avif?t=1773562420\" width=1080 height=608 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.webm?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/09cff7981a8c2a9f34c4d9dc42f032d8.mp4?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1773562420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125070?t=1773562420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/aa1c1b02b05599160fc883f03082fe5e0fea89fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773562420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/aa1c1b02b05599160fc883f03082fe5e0fea89fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773562420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4424200,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.poster.avif?t=1773562420\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.webm?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125070/extras/95e85a41f13eb0681c8f18bc55ed4adc.mp4?t=1773562420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jack the Reaper has had enough. He is done being part of the bad guys. With the help of various mentors, he borrows powers from other infamous Halloween Creatures, like Count the Vampire or Grim the Death Reaper (and much more). 